    "body": "Child of #1520. Preserve original runner 4d0defa0, now included in #1521; harden existing code rather than replace it. Required: internal control state, mandatory verified host/storage identities, actual RSS/pressure/disk observations, immutable claim/attempt/source/executable/input binding, singleton and one heavy lane, gated launch and PID-reuse safety, conservative interrupted-state recovery, durable receipt then exactly-once charge then finalization, explicit reviewed ledger baseline and late-record reconciliation, GitHub-outage outbox and protected delivery checks. No smoke ledger may become production.\n\nAcceptance: executed focused tests for race, stale-session, crash boundaries, process identity, resource stops, ledger replay/corruption and outage/replay; exact-head independent review and council for the shared policy; protected delivery. Production pilot is tracked separately so code delivery does not imply deployment.\n",
