      "body": "**Acceptance complete at this child issue's written scope.** The original runner was preserved and extended, then delivered through #1521's protected queue. The 86-test pass at the prior control-plane head is explicitly reused at its unchanged scope, with final PATH-delta compilation/three focused tests and 23 workflow fixtures. Two exact-head nonauthor approvals and three council seats are retained. Reviewed head a345e766 and merge7895501d have identical Git trees. Production activation, clients and administrative enforcement remain separate #1525 acceptance.\n\nIndependent final acceptance audit and exact evidence links/hashes: https://github.com/UOR-Foundation/uor-r4/blob/codex/lab-state/integration/20260930/closeout/child-acceptance-1523-1524.md (SHA-256 a20bd9d6f33a09b4358db93b836da425bf71ed1ec32309c06a01e8a69964e887).\n\nClosing this completed child. #1520/#1525 remain open for their remaining operational requirements; no model capability or automatic client startup is implied.",
